{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:23.816540+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @altimofeev \r\n\r\nThe issue with `top_k` returning different first values for different `k` values has been resolved in JAX 0.4.34. I have verified this on a cloud VM with 4xT4 GPUs. The `top_k` function now consistently returns the same first value for both `k=1` and `k=4`. Please see the attached screenshot for confirmation.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04951154-d083-496a-8a4d-46829842fdda)\r\n\r\nThank you.","created_at":"2024-10-18T06:25:29Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271#issuecomment-2421528249","id":2421528249,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc6QVZa5","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2421528249/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-10-18T06:25:29Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/2421528249","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153593711?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rajasekharporeddy","id":153593711,"login":"rajasekharporeddy","node_id":"U_kgDOCSenbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nIt seems that `jax.lax.top_k` behaves incorrectly when input is sharded across dimension used for computing top-k.\r\n\r\nIn particular, the following code shows that the elements of top-1 and top-4 are inconsistent with each other.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport numpy as np\r\nimport jax\r\nfrom jax.experimental.pjit import pjit\r\nfrom jax.sharding import Mesh, PartitionSpec\r\n\r\ndef fn(x):\r\n    v1, _ = jax.lax.top_k(x, k=1)\r\n    v4, _ = jax.lax.top_k(x, k=4)\r\n    return v1, v4\r\n\r\npfn = pjit(\r\n    fn,\r\n    in_shardings=(PartitionSpec(None, 'data'),),\r\n)\r\n\r\nwith Mesh(np.array(jax.devices()), ('data',)):\r\n    r1, r4 = pfn(jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), [2, 8*1024]))\r\n    print('top-1', r1[0])\r\n    print('top-4', r4[0])\r\n```\r\n\r\nPrints:\r\n```\r\ntop-1 [3.671912]\r\ntop-4 [3.7298186 3.671912  3.4914806 3.418947 ]\r\n```\r\nWhich is incorrect, since top-1 can't be less than top-1 of top-4.\r\nNote, the code works for input shape of `[1,  8*1024]`.\r\n\r\nTested on  `NCCL version 2.19.3+cuda12.3`, `jax 0.4.23` on a mesh of 8 GPUs.\r\n\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\njax 0.4.23, jaxlib 0.4.23\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nGPU x 8\n\n### Additional system info?\n\nuname_result(system='Linux', release='5.4.253-167.359.amzn2.x86_64', version='#1 SMP Tue Aug 15 21:40:23 UTC 2023', machine='x86_64')\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n```\r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| NVIDIA-SMI 470.182.03   Driver Version: 470.182.03   CUDA Version: 12.2     |\r\n|-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n| GPU  Name        Persistence-M| Bus-Id        Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\r\n| Fan  Temp  Perf  Pwr:Usage/Cap|         Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\r\n|                               |                      |               MIG M. |\r\n|===============================+======================+======================|\r\n|   0  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:10:1C.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   37C    P0    54W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   1  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:10:1D.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   34C    P0    57W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   2  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:20:1C.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   36C    P0    54W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   3  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:20:1D.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   34C    P0    56W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   4  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:90:1C.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   37C    P0    57W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   5  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:90:1D.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   34C    P0    55W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   6  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:A0:1C.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   37C    P0    59W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n|   7  NVIDIA A100-SXM...  On   | 00000000:A0:1D.0 Off |                    0 |\r\n| N/A   36C    P0    54W / 400W |      0MiB / 40536MiB |      0%      Default |\r\n|                               |                      |             Disabled |\r\n+-------------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+\r\n                                                                               \r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n| Processes:                                                                  |\r\n|  GPU   GI   CI        PID   Type   Process name                  GPU Memory |\r\n|        ID   ID                                                   Usage      |\r\n|=============================================================================|\r\n|  No running processes found                                                 |\r\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+\r\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271/comments","created_at":"2024-01-09T19:12:08Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/19271","id":2073000469,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},